is that they're all set up

00:42:07.460 --> 00:42:10.620
on a feeling of success

00:42:10.620 --> 00:42:11.940
that can't be translated

00:42:11.940 --> 00:42:13.300
to a video game

00:42:13.300 --> 00:42:14.620
that just amounts to points.

00:42:16.280 --> 00:42:17.380
Points are satisfying

00:42:17.380 --> 00:42:18.640
in a game like Donkey Kong

00:42:18.640 --> 00:42:20.040
because that's the only way

00:42:20.040 --> 00:42:21.180
that that can happen

00:42:21.180 --> 00:42:22.620
is via video game.

00:42:23.000 --> 00:42:25.260
Right? Donkey Kong cannot translate

00:42:25.260 --> 00:42:26.400
back to a game show

00:42:26.400 --> 00:42:28.040
and now all of a sudden win money.

00:42:28.040 --> 00:42:29.600
I'd love to see it,

00:42:29.780 --> 00:42:30.760
but it's not happening yet.

00:42:32.180 --> 00:42:33.900
Family Feud and all these other ones

00:42:33.900 --> 00:42:35.100
have the reverse problem

00:42:35.100 --> 00:42:37.640
and so tie that into

00:42:37.640 --> 00:42:39.180
a limited question pool

00:42:39.180 --> 00:42:40.700
and eventual repetition

00:42:40.700 --> 00:42:42.260
if you play this enough

00:42:42.260 --> 00:42:45.140
and some inconsistent answer matching.

00:42:45.380 --> 00:42:47.100
I just feel like

00:42:47.100 --> 00:42:48.580
it's not going to be

00:42:48.580 --> 00:42:49.600
on the Essential Games list,

00:42:49.880 --> 00:42:51.140
but that said,

00:42:51.400 --> 00:42:53.680
it does do the Family Feud experience

00:42:53.680 --> 00:42:55.080
and so I feel a little bad

00:42:55.080 --> 00:42:56.320
being mean to it.

00:42:58.320 --> 00:43:02.100
Wow. This was one of our better episodes,

00:43:02.200 --> 00:43:04.560
huh guys? I guess if you say so.

00:43:04.920 --> 00:43:05.780
Yeah, if you say so.

00:43:05.900 --> 00:43:07.540
The love of Family Feud

00:43:07.540 --> 00:43:08.540
really shined through.

00:43:08.960 --> 00:43:09.940
I feel like,

00:43:09.940 --> 00:43:12.400
you know, maybe we should love Beetlejuice

00:43:12.400 --> 00:43:13.620
just as much as we love Family Feud.

00:43:13.620 --> 00:43:14.800
Do you think we could get on

00:43:14.800 --> 00:43:16.640
Family Feud as like the nostalgia crew?

00:43:17.460 --> 00:43:18.880
Well, they're doing that now, right?

00:43:18.960 --> 00:43:20.080
Like they do things where it's like,

00:43:20.640 --> 00:43:22.260
here's the Survivor family

00:43:22.260 --> 00:43:24.680
and here's the...

00:43:24.680 --> 00:43:27.380
Nostalgia crew. Yeah, the nostalgia crew, right.

00:43:27.600 --> 00:43:28.980
The perfect matchup, really.

00:43:29.040 --> 00:43:29.980
It really shows you

00:43:29.980 --> 00:43:30.880
the breakdown

00:43:30.880 --> 00:43:32.600
of the concept of Family

00:43:32.600 --> 00:43:33.740
at the societal level.

00:43:34.380 --> 00:43:35.260
Yeah, that's what

00:43:35.260 --> 00:43:36.280
they're going for, yeah.

00:43:36.540 --> 00:43:37.640
And I'd love to see

00:43:37.640 --> 00:43:38.780
if the Survivor family

00:43:38.780 --> 00:43:40.260
knows as much about Nostalgia

00:43:40.260 --> 00:43:42.040
as I know about Survivor.

00:43:42.640 --> 00:44:10.820
They probably do. Thank you.
